Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 17:15:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 40/42] bitproxy: in-tunnel health check and restart after
 process death

Every 3 minutes while a network is up, a STUN request goes through the
VPN outbound; two failures in a row rebuild sing-box (backoff 3 to 30
min). The service is sticky again, and a system restart after our
process died only brings the VPN back if it was running.
